um\nInsured\nPayable Premium\n25 Lacs\n\u20b9 39,346\n\n1 Year Premium\n\u20b9 39.346\n\nPAY NOW\n\n**99.9%** new policies applied \nvia website and mobile apps\n[Image: Im3]\n[Image: Im2]\n\n**88.3%** renewals \ncompleted without human \nintervention\n[Image: Im5]\n[Image: Im4]\n\n**91.5%** claims submitted \ndigitally\n[Image: Im9]\n[Image: Im8]\n\n---\n\n## Our Value Chain is Significantly Automated with Analytics Embedded into 4 Operations\n\n**Partner Onboarding**\n\nModular API based\npartner integration\n\n**Customer Sourcing**\n\nDigital Dukaan and Niva Bupa \nUNO mobile applications for \nagent training\n\n**99.9%**\n\nNew policies applied \ndigitally\n\n**Underwriting**\n\nPayments made digitally\n\nRule based automated \ndecisioning\n\nReal-time lead scoring \nsupported by product \nrecommendation engine\n\nRetail policies autodecisioned\n\n**Claims Management**\n\nLTV-based approach to \nidentify upsell or cross-sell \nopportunities\n\n**91.5%**\n\nDigital claims submission\n\nReal-time fraud \ndetection capability\n\nOutlier detection tool used \nfor billing review\n\n**28.5%**\n\nCashless Claims Auto-\nAdjudication\n\n**Policy Renewal**\n\nPolicy renewal without \nhuman intervention\n\nPredictive machine-based \nlearning model to target \nhigh lapse probability cases\n\n---\n\n**5 Disciplined Underwriting and Business Selection Through LTV-Based Approach**\n\n## Product-to-customer, segment- PROFILE EXPERIENCE\n\n**COST OF** \n**ACQUISITION**\n\nCUSTOMER CLAIMS \nPROFILE EXPERIENCE\nLOCATION\nRISK PERCEPTION\nRETURN ON\n\n**MEDICAL** \n**INFLATION**\n\n**FUTURE**\n**PREMIUM**\n**CHANGE**\n\n**INVESTMENT**\n**INCOME**\n\n**REQUIRED**\n**CAPITAL**\n\n**DISTRIBUTION**\n**CHANNEL**\n\n**LTV-**\n**Based** \n**Scale**\n\n**COHORT-WISE** \n**LOSS RATIO**\n\n**Rating**\n\n**Follow-Up** \n**Action**\n\n## Action RISK PERCEPTION\nSignificant Over Index LTV-\n\n##### Significant\n\n**Product-to-customer, segmentto-channel mapping**\n[Image: Im1]\n\n##### Decision Vectors\n\n**Identify opportunities** for upsell \nor cross-sell to customers with \nhigh LTV\n[Image: Im2]\n\n**Customized** and pre-qualified \noffers for each customer\n[Image: Im4]\n\n**Sales channel alignment** of\n\nincentives and monthly review \nto increase renewals\n[Image: Im3]\n\nUse **differentiated interventions** \n[Image: Im5]\n\nto maximize customer retention\n\n---\n\n## 5 Our Multi-Pronged Claims Management Strategy\n\n1 **Developing Partnerships and Strengthening Relationships with Network Hospitals**\nExpansion of Network of Preferred Partner Network (PPN) Hospitals\n\n2 **Auto Adjudication**\nPaperless Auto Adjudication Portal for Health Insurance Claims Processing\n\n3 **Robust Fraud Detection**\nReal Time Detection of Outliers in Claims Based on Disease, Treatment Provider, Location And Policy Seller\n\n4 **Billing Review**\nRandom Checks and Case-Specific Triggers to Identify Anomalies\n\n5 **Case Management**\nCost Component Review on a Claim-by-Claim Basis with Medical Providers\n\n---\n\n## Our Hospital Network and PPN Hospitals Helps Improve Customer Satisfaction 5 Levels While Improving Control on Cost of Claims\n\n<u><strong>Network of Hospitals (#)</strong></u>\n\n| Category | Network of Hospitals (#) |\n| --- | --- |\n| FY2022 | 8562 |\n| FY2023 | 10005 |\n| FY2024 | 10460 |\n| FY2025 | 10421 |\n\n<u><strong>Preferred Partner Network (#)</strong></u>\n\n| Category | Series 1 (unlabelled) (#) | Preferred Partner Network Live in Cities (#) |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| FY2023 | 201 | 9 |\n| FY2024 | 326 | 20 |\n| FY2025 | 589 | 40 |\n\n### Benefits of PPN Hospitals\n\n### For Customers\n\nPPN claims \ncontribution in \nPPN cities ~15%\n\nFree ambulance \nservices and \ndesignated \nrelationship manager\n\nDiscount on \npharmacy, diagnostics \nand consultations \neven after discharge\n\n### For Niva Bupa\n\nFavourable discount \npackages, controlling \ncost of claims\n\n---\n\n## 5 Our Domain Knowledge and Experience in Claims Cost Manageme