tor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2025-26/Intimation-Board-Meeting-2026.pdf?v=1.1) Disclosure Regulation 30 IRDAI https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2025-26/Disclosure-Regulation-30-IRDAI-Approval-042026.pdf?v=1.1) https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2025-26/Disclosure-Regulation-30-IRDAI-Approval-042026.pdf?v=1.1) Certificate 74 5 quarter ended 2026 https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2025-26/Certificate-Regulation-74(5)-quarter-ended-March-2026.pdf?v=1.1)\nRegulation 76 Reconciliation Report _March 2025 https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/Regulation-76-Reconciliation-Report_March-2025.pdf?v=1.0) pdf icon https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/Regulation-76-Reconciliation-Report_March-2025.pdf?v=1.0) Details Compliance 6 1 quarter ended https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/Intimation-under-Regulation-6(1)-Compliance-Officer.pdf?v=1.0) https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/Intimation-under-Regulation-6(1)-Compliance-Officer.pdf?v=1.0)\nDetails RTA Regulation 7 1 quarter ended 2025 https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/Intimation-under-Regulation-7(1)-RTA.pdf?v=1.0) pdf icon https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/Intimation-under-Regulation-7(1)-RTA.pdf?v=1.0) Reporting https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/Half-Yearly-disclosure-Debt.pdf?v=1.0) https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/Half-Yearly-disclosure-Debt.pdf?v=1.0) Disclosure Corporate https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/Initial-Disclosure-Large-Corporate.pdf?v=1.1)\nDisclosure Regulation 30 IRDAI https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2024-25/Disclosure-under-Regulation-30-IRDAI-Approval.pdf?v=1.0) pdf icon https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2024-25/Disclosure-under-Regulation-30-IRDAI-Approval.pdf?v=1.0.pdf) NBHI Intimation Debenture https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2024-25/NBHI-Record-Date-Intimation-for-Interest-Payment-to-Debenture-Holders.pdf) https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2024-25/NBHI-Record-Date-Intimation-for-Interest-Payment-to-Debenture-Holders.pdf)\nNewspaper publication financial results ended 2024 https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/NBHINewspaperpublication15062024.pdf) pdf icon https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/NBHINewspaperpublication15062024.pdf) Disclosure Regulation 51 https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/NSEIntimationRTAChange.pdf) https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fin-disclosures/NSEIntimationRTAChange.pdf) Proceedings EGM 21,2024 https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/other-fi